WEBVTT

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:35.920
Set...

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.170
Set...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:41.650
Finished...

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.290
Tired...

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.730
Good work, Connor.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.300
Rest for a bit and prepare for the Cabernet.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.340
R-Right...

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.810
Wow, what an appetite, Connor.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:07.420
It's 'cause I have to use 
Yellow Explosions soon.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.840
That's right! You're our ace, buddy!

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.450
What's wrong?

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:18.760
Don't cough it up, eat more! Or 
should I force it down for you?

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.570
I wonder how Sylvette's doing?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.930
Sylvette is 100 times more 
powerful than you, Lag, but...

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:21.810
100?

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:27.280
She's a little weaker since Gauche 
disappeared, but still stronger than you.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.100
Yeah...

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.200
Welcome home, Brother...

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.490
That's why I have to get them back...

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.970
Gauche's heart... and Sylvette's smile.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:52.680
A Place to Return To

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.330
Stand up. We're almost there.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.050
Make them climb.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:45.250
Lawrence intends to offer those strong hearts 
to the Cabernet, greatly increasing its power,

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.740
and take down the artificial sun.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.720
They won't let themselves 
be killed by Lawrence.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.150
In that case...

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.630
Sorry, but we're still closed.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.960
Dear! Dear!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.800
What's with the yelling early in the morning?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.110
S-Suede...

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.370
Come on, eat.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:24.160
Suede, where did you go?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.320
Sylvette was worried about you.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.080
I am no longer Gauche Suede.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.460
Did you tell her that?

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:40.700
We've got a customer.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.600
So, what are you here for?

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:53.050
This is you we're talking about. You didn't 
come just to chat about the old days, I presume.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.470
Give me a shindanjuu, please.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.980
What happened to your Gymnopédie?

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.620
Well, if you don't want to 
talk about it, I won't pry.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:23.590
This amber isn't nearly as pure 
as the ones the Bee Hive provides.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.450
You only get a few shots.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.640
It might break pretty soon.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.610
But that's all I can get ready for you now.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:34.960
Thank you very much.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:42.050
Hey.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.160
Be careful out there, Suede.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:50.150
To be human, you need both heart and life.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:05:59.870
Brother!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:17.350
Oh, Brother, you... Disappearing 
so suddenly like that...

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.320
What a fright you gave me...

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.860
You are my brother.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.890
Even if your heart doesn't return,

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.280
you will still be my brother.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.020
Now and forever.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.200
I am no longer your...

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.150
You can't think of me as your sister?

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.700
It's impossible for you to 
live as Gauche Suede now?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:06.000
I am sorry...

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:43.550
I see.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.690
Yup... Got it...

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:52.880
After all, once you decide on something, 
you never change your mind, Brother.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.980
It was the same way when 
you left for Akatsuki.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.350
I'm sure you have something 
important going on.

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.970
But, you know what?

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:08.920
I'll always, always... be your sister.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:12.320
So if you ever feel like returning,

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.850
you can come back anytime, got it?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.280
I'll make my soup and wait for you.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.950
So... So...

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.010
Thank you, Sylvette.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.050
Goodbye.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.200
Brother...

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:13.280
Signal and Signalness have 
gone missing from the Bifrost?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:20.350
Yes. When coming back from Yodaka, someone 
had opened the fence, and they were gone.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:22.790
I can't believe it...

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:29.480
Sub-Master?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.380
Oh, sorry. You can go now.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.000
Who could have...

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.140
Noir...

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.310
I wonder where it'll come from?

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.020
Who knows.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:36.680
Here.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.080
What're those?

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.300
They're the cookies that 
Sunny baked in Lament.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.870
Eat these and get up your energy.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.700
I don't want anyone else's 
heart to be sacrificed.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:03.250
Yeah.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:16.770
It's here!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.020
Okay!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.940
The land mines I bury are 
fragments of my hunger!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.440
Yes! Yellow Explosion!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.450
Here we go!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.170
Right!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.420
Lag!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:45.750
Who's there?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.200
Who else?

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:56.010
Who else would have such 
impeccable dramatic timing?

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:56.950
Garrard...

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.200
Valentine!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.550
It's no use. You cannot stop the Cabernet.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.850
I'll aim for your heart next.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:06.450
Farewell.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:13.300
Girly!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.250
We're going to finish this today.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.510
I'm not "girly"! I'm Niche!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.660
I can predict your attacks, girly!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:42.530
You should worry about yourself 
more than your dingo.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:54.590
Lag!

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.650
We don't have time to 
get held up by this guy!

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.940
Let's go and beat the Cabernet, right away!

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:00.920
R-Right...

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.410
Sorry, girly.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.130
But <i>I'm</i> the first-rate dingo!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.620
Lag, Zazie!

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.440
The Cabernet is coming soon!

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:43.880
Got it!

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:57.020
Lag!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.640
I'm fine! You get the Cabernet!

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.690
Why?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.650
Begging for your life? It won't work.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.000
You delivered people's hearts 
as a Letter Bee, right?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.040
Then, how could you...?

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:25.550
Just as foolishly honest and 
innocent as always, I see.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:29.170
I can see you haven't learned anything.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.750
Yes, I was a Letter Bee.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.840
I delivered letters. I 
delivered people's hearts.

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:38.970
And I was promoted to Akatsuki.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.190
Just as you aim to become Head Bee.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:47.340
But what was waiting for me in Akatsuki...

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.300
...was despair.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.030
Deliver people's hearts?

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.730
Don't make me laugh!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.860
Oh, sure I delivered them.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.660
...straight to the artificial sun.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:03.460
I delivered the suffering, squirming 
hearts of people not wanting to die...

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:07.210
I've seen people throw away their 
lives in front of my very eyes!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.520
All because of that artificial sun!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.430
That's the job of a Letter Bee.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.350
That's also why Noir lost his heart.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.400
That's...

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.600
I have no reason to lie now.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:27.800
Even knowing that, you'll work for the 
government and aim to be Head Bee?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.490
The Carbernet disappeared into 
the ground near the Shark Cape...

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.830
The key missing from the Bee Hive...

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:42.350
The gatekeepers gone missing...

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.980
What's the connection?

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:53.160
Master... Why'd you have to 
leave at such an important time?

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.510
Now I can't ask your advice...

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.790
Doctor Thunderland?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.450
That's strange...

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.490
What is the meaning of this?

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:48.270
I will have you help us, Sub-Master.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:57.490
It's over.

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.100
Here it comes!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.380
That's not the Cabernet!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.450
But, why?

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.970
We knew you were lying 
in wait for the Cabernet.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:19.560
Of course we'd have a counter plan!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.040
These are fragments of Spirit Amber.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.900
They work wonders for luring gaichuu.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.750
It is too bad you cannot see the 
worth of having the Cabernet

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.650
take down the artificial sun, boy.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.920
Run, Lag!

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:41.850
Connor!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:47.450
Take this!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:57.460
Zazie!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.490
Connor!

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.270
Shindan Loaded!

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:20.420
G-Gauche...

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:46.700
Next: To Akatsuki
